<title>ESTONIA: VIRU RAND JULY TURNOVER 32.1 MNL KROONS.</title>
<headline>VIRU RAND JULY TURNOVER 32.1 MNL KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viru Rand fish processor said on Thursday that its July net turnover was 32.1 million kroons.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said that production of processed fish reached 36.9 million kroons in July, which was an increase of 60 percent compared to July in the previous year.</p>
<p>In July, Viru Rand exported 27.5 million kroons worth of products compared to June's 20.7 million kroons.</p>
<p>Exports in July to Russia totalled 14.9 million kroons and to Ukraine 12.2 million kroons.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
